{"assets":["/statement-assets/db8199253a6589c7de8144c6ead072cee877aeed51af7417586080cb532bad1f.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1199","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Water Lily"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"While sailing on a boat, Inessa noticed a beautiful water lily flower above the lake's surface. She came closer and it turned out that the lily was exactly $$$H$$$ centimeters above the water surface. Inessa grabbed the flower and sailed the distance of $$$L$$$ centimeters. Exactly at this point the flower touched the water surface."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/db8199253a6589c7de8144c6ead072cee877aeed51af7417586080cb532bad1f.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Suppose that the lily grows at some point $$$A$$$ on the lake bottom, and its stem is always a straight segment with one endpoint at point $$$A$$$. Also suppose that initially the flower was exactly above the point $$$A$$$, i.e. its stem was vertical. Can you determine the depth of the lake at point $$$A$$$?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line contains two integers $$$H$$$ and $$$L$$$ ($$$1 \\le H \\lt L \\le 10^{6}$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single number — the depth of the lake at point $$$A$$$. The absolute or relative error should not exceed $$$10^{-6}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Formally, let your answer be $$$A$$$, and the jury's answer be $$$B$$$. Your answer is accepted if and only if $$$\\frac{|A - B|}{\\max{(1, |B|)}} \\le 10^{-6}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1.5000000000000\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2.6666666666667\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1199B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1199/problem/B"}